        "quote": "(a) The Governing Body of the City of Topeka, Kansas, hereby authorizes the combination of the City’s water and water pollution control utility and the City’s stormwater utility into a single utility to be known as the water, water pollution control, and stormwater utility of the City of Topeka, Kansas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.017:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
